# ============================================================
#  electrical-lfs-sandbox  —  file handling rules
# ============================================================
#
#  This sandbox uses plain text files only, so there are no
#  Git LFS rules here.
#
#  The real repo (electrical-lfs) tracks Danfoss GUIDE files
#  (.p1x, .p1d, .scs) with Git LFS. Day to day that works the
#  same as anything else: add, commit, push. See CONTRIBUTING.md
#  if you want the details.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
#  Line endings
# ------------------------------------------------------------
#  Normalize text files to LF inside the repo, check out native
#  on Windows. Keeps diffs clean across machines.
* text=auto

#  Files that must never be line-ending converted
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.zip   binary
